- character skins;
- weapon skins;
- VFX;
- emotes;
- home decorations;
- character cosmetics;
- card cosmetics;
- profile cosmetics;
- frames;
- effects;
- seasonal cosmetic content.

Монетизация не должна смешиваться с core gameplay.

